        "answer": {
          "short": "$A$ and $B$ are disjoint.\n\nInclusion–exclusion gives $|A\\cap B|=60+60-120=0$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}|A\\cap B|&=|A|+|B|-|A\\cup B|\\\\|A\\cap B|&=60+60-120\\\\|A\\cap B|&=0\\end{align*}$$\n\nThere are no common elements, so $A$ and $B$ are disjoint.",
